{"session_log":"session.v3.jsonl","event":{"type":"user/message","seq":10,"time":1790224634183,"data":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nThe following workspace instructions may be relevant to your work. Use them as guidance when applicable. More specific instructions take precedence over broader ones. They do not override system, developer, or direct user instructions.\n\nInstructions from: $DSH_HOME/AGENTS.md\n\n\n\nInstructions from: AGENTS.md\n\n# 威胁研判运行约定\n\n只使用 analyze_threat_incident 执行研判。名单快速分类、五源融合及固定 v14 研判提示词均由工具封装；会话不读取审计文件、人工标签或历史验证答案。\n\n结果中的 status 与 validation 是运行及契约状态，不等于分类正确性。快速分类存在白名单误分类的已知限制，history 尚未接入真实查询。\n\n</system-reminder>"}],"source":{"kind":"agent-instructions","form":"instructions","baseline":true,"baselineIdentity":"{\"projectRoot\":\"\",\"projectRootMarkers\":[\".git\"],\"maxBytes\":65536,\"maxSourceBytes\":1048576,\"instructionFileCandidates\":[\"AGENTS.md\",\"CLAUDE.md\"],\"localInstructionFileCandidates\":[\"AGENTS.local.md\",\"CLAUDE.local.md\"]}","changes":[{"action":"set","scope":"user-global\u0000AGENTS.md","path":"$DSH_HOME/AGENTS.md","digest":"da39a3ee5e6b4b0d3255bfef95601890afd80709"},{"action":"set","scope":".\u0000AGENTS.md","path":"AGENTS.md","digest":"50677caeaddb7e039129d649baab16c4d6644157"}]},"role":"user","id":"fd80c397-74df-43b1-987c-5cc5578d2ada"},"surfaceOp":"append"}}
